title: InnerDialogue_Truth
---
<<declare $voice2 = "Lady">>
{$voice2}: You’ve come far... but you’re still hiding something.
-> “I’m not hiding anything.” 
    {$voice2}: Lies are heavier when you believe them.
-> “Maybe you’re right.”
    {$voice2}: Then why keep walking in circles?
-> [silent]
    {$voice2}: Silence isn’t peace.
